<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · text</p><h1 class="enc-title">History of the Country of Albania</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">10th century</span> · <a href="/centuries/10th-century">10th century</a> · Also known as History of the Aghuans</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The History of the Country of Albania is an Armenian-language history of Caucasian Albania attributed to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/movses-kaghankatvatsi">Movses Kaghankatvatsi</a>, probably compiled in the tenth century from older material. In three books it covers the country from its legendary origins through its kings, its church and the Mihranid princes to the period of Arab rule. It is the main native source for the history of the kingdom.</p></div>
